*~

# --- OS ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Project runtime artifacts ---
# Research runs produce workspace data (search results, paper analyses, run
# state, logs). This is committed project data — the authoritative record of
# research runs. Keep it tracked.
*.log

# --- Build output ---
# dist/ is a local packaging artifact produced by scripts/package_skill.py.
# It is never committed; rebuild it locally when needed.
dist/

